@startuml
' SUPER!!! Thrilled about plantuml, been using it for years now. no idea
' anyone else at umd knew about it, first time I've seen it mentioned.
' baffles me why anyone would use "enterprise architect" instead

title TaskPad PHP - Classes

class Task {
  - id : string
  - title : string
  - description : string
  - priority : string
  - due : ?string
  - completed : bool
}

class TaskRepository {
  - path : string = "data/tasks.json"
  + all() : Task[]
  + add(task : Task) : void
  + complete(id : string) : void
  + delete(id : string) : void
}

class Validator {
  - priorities : string[] = Low, Medium, High
  + validateCreate(input : array) : array
}

class Controller {
  + handlePost() : void
  + handleGet(q : string, priority : string) : void
}

note right of Controller
  index.php
end note

Controller --> TaskRepository : uses
Controller --> Validator : uses
TaskRepository "1" o-- "*" Task
@enduml
